{"id": "q_wolf_status", "question": "End of Session 12: is the Wolf alive, dead, still corrupted-what's his state?", "answer": "TL;DR: The Wolf is **dead** at the end of Session 12—he was decapitated; prior to that, he was acting under cult corruption.\n\n**Explanation:**  \n- **OBSERVED:** Bonogo “**Removed the Wolf’s head to take it to the academy**,” which is a terminal outcome indicating death. This is the most current and definitive state.  \n- **CANON (prior state):** The Wolf had been “subtly leading key figures of the city guard into the cult’s fold,” indicating he was **corrupted/influenced by the cult** before his death.\n\nNo conflicting facts override this; the decapitation is the latest event and determines his final state.\n\n**Key Attributes:**  \n- **Operational Status:** Dead (decapitated)  \n- **Physical Condition:** “Removed the Wolf’s head to take it to the academy”  \n- **Affiliation/Corruption:** Previously corrupted by the cult (The Shepherd’s Flock)", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 2069, "post_filter_count": 70, "duration_ms": 56, "top_5": [["ent_eirik", 1.3478], ["ent_the_wolf", 1.1637], ["ent_torbin_jove", 1.0], ["ent_mercenaries", 0.9639], ["ent_city_guard", 0.8979]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_eirik", "ent_the_wolf", "ent_torbin_jove", "ent_mercenaries", "ent_city_guard", "ent_draven", "ent_speak_with_dead", "ent_lyra", "ent_zyla_cinderbranch", "ent_key", "ent_moment_of_decision", "ent_great_shepherd", "ent_divine_reflection_pool", "ent_seed", "ent_dead_gods_corrupted_flesh", "ent_the_butcher", "ent_corruption", "ent_harvek", "ent_fast_eyed_and_disarming", "ent_seren_darkroot", "ent_commander_thalia_ashenvale", "ent_insight", "ent_wolf", "ent_public_performer", "ent_gnome", "ent_group", "ent_jorin", "ent_cedric_the_bard", "ent_baegrom", "ent_jaren_the_voice_thornfield", "ent_the_witness_seed_branchbound_binding_mechanism", "ent_council", "ent_bonogo", "ent_mirathorn_city_council", "en