{"id": "q_pre_post", "question": "Before vs after the council fight-how's the Wolf different?", "answer": "TL;DR: Before the council fight, the Wolf is an active manipulator and cult agent; after, he is dead—“Removed the Wolf’s head to take it to the academy.”\n\nBefore the council fight:\n- CANON: The Wolf is a key infiltrator for the cult, “subtly leading key figures of the city guard into the cult’s fold” (the cult history).\n- This positions him as an influential, covert operator embedded in Mirathorn’s power structure.\n\nAfter the council fight:\n- OBSERVED: Bonogo “Dealing major damage to Wolf” and ultimately “Removed the Wolf’s head to take it to the academy.”\n- This is a terminal outcome; the Wolf is no longer an active agent in play.\n\nCurrent state:\n- The OBSERVED outcome overrides prior status: the Wolf’s manipulation and leadership role has ended due to his death.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: Cult infiltrator and corrupter of the city guard (CANON)\n- Status change: From active manipulator → dead (OBSERVED)\n- Cause of change: Bonogo’s attack and decapitation (OBSERVED)", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 2069, "post_filter_count": 66, "duration_ms": 46, "top_5": [["ent_eirik", 1.4565], ["ent_key", 1.2], ["ent_the_wolf", 1.1365], ["ent_city_guard", 1.0294], ["ent_commander_thalia_ashenvale", 1.0294]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_eirik", "ent_key", "ent_the_wolf", "ent_city_guard", "ent_commander_thalia_ashenvale", "ent_the_fight", "The_Shepherd_s_Council", "ent_council", "ent_secret_escape_tunnel", "ent_copper_moss_brewery", "scout", "ent_painted_cloth_banner", "ent_barns", "ent_tables", "ent_bonogo", "ent_goblin", "ent_sewer", "ent_clerks", "ent_the_festival_of_expansion", "ent_scimitars", "ent_a_broken_sword", "ent_gorvin", "ent_potions", "ent_mirathorn_city_council", "ent_speak_with_dead", "ent_mirathorn", "ent_wolf", "ent_public_performer", "ent_corruption", "ent_lyra", "ent_group", "ent_leadershi